# _headers: response headers Cloudflare Workers static assets adds to the site.
# The 3D model library is read cross-origin by every host that renders a
# model-viewer card (Paw OS at os.pocketpaw.xyz, the embed on other sites), so
# the GLB files must allow any origin. They are public assets with no cookies.
/models/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
